{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25743","headline":"春色满皇州 · 封敖","name":"春色满皇州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝里春光正，葱茏喜气浮。\n锦铺仙禁侧，镜写曲江头。\n红蕚开萧阁，黄丝拂御楼。\n千门歌吹动，九陌绮罗游。\n日近风先满，仁深泽共流。\n应非顦顇质，辛苦在神州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"封敖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}